          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"gallery1\" group=\"Sliders & Galleries\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showSubtitle\" title=\"Subtitle\" checked>\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"autoSize\" title=\"Auto Size\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"imageHeight\" title=\"Height\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"autoSize && !(showButtons==false && showCardSubtitle==false && showCardTitle==false && showText==false)\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Spacing\" name=\"spacing\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showCardTitle\" title=\"Title\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showText\" title=\"Text\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"showButtons\" title=\"Buttons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"transparent\" title=\"Transparent BG\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"cardsBg\" title=\"BG\" value=\"#649AFC\" condition=\"(transparent==false)\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" required>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/bg-asthetic.jpg\" selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#d5d5cf\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#101903\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type == 'image'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>INTRODUCTION - The Creative Craft Development Initiative</b></h4>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\"><div><i style>CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more body copy&nbsp;contents and well written coming&nbsp;into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is body copy&nbsp;contents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right body copy.</i></div></h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/certification2.jpg\" alt=\"Delivery Services with IFEX express Experience to do great work\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more bodycopy contents and well written comming into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is bodycopy contentents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right bodycopy.\n<br>\n<br><br></p>\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><b>CCDI is a mission-driven organization</b> committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more bodycopy contents and well written comming into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is bodycopy contentents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right bodycopy. CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development.</h5>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-success-outline\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">CHECK MORE SERVICES ON A77</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/certification-1.jpg\" alt=\"Creative Crafts\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more bodycopy contents and well written comming into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is bodycopy contentents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right bodycopy.\n<br>\n<br><br></p>\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><div><b>CCDI is a mission-driven organization</b> committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more bodycopy contents and well written comming into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is bodycopy contentents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right bodycopy. CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development.</div></h5>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-info\" target=\"_blank\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">NEFIK COLLECTIVE VOICES</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"item-img\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/certification.jpg\" alt=\"Ambassadors Magazine\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-content\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle || showCardSubtitle || showText || showButtons\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more bodycopy contents and well written comming into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is bodycopy contentents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right bodycopy.\n<br>\n<br></p>\n                        <h5 class=\"item-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".item-title\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><br></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"><b>CCDI is a mission-driven organization</b> committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development. more bodycopy contents and well written comming into spaces to cover this contents spaces by the website owners or organisation team developer. This is bodycopy contentents structure, shall be completed with the correct and right bodycopy. CCDI is a mission-driven organization committed to addressing youth unemployment, community health, rehabilitation, family strengthening, and education through holistic empowerment, vocational training, child welfare, and sustainable social enterprise development.&nbsp;</span><div><br></div><div>\n<br><span style=\"background-color: transparent;\"></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\">&nbsp;<br></span></div></div></h5>\n                        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn item-footer mt-2\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove,-mbrBtnAdd\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn item-btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">AMBASSADORS MAGAZINE</a></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
